 {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [253, 294], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["1. multimodal_reference_definitions\n<Image 1> is the character identity AND environment reference: young East Asian woman with long dark half-tied hair and loose face-framing strands, white tank top with a light gray sleeveless hooded vest draped over the shoulders, denim shorts; seated on a bed with white bedding, brown teddy bear at her side, sheer curtains with small orange floral prints behind, soft warm natural window light.\n<Audio 1> is the STRICT voice timbre reference: gentle, healing, warm female voice.\n\n2. environment_classification_and_movement_strategy\nEnvironment source: <Image 1> as declared by the user. Classification: INDOOR STATIC (cozy bedroom, bed, floral curtains, soft daylight). Movement strategy: immersive seated confiding with slow push-in cinematography and focus shifts; subtle micro-movements only (gaze lifting from the book, gentle head tilt, fingers resting on the pages, slight posture shift); walking and standing FORBIDDEN; no robotic motion.\n\n3. allocation_pacing_and_cutting_plan\nTotal script 131 chars over 30s; unified pacing tier: Steady confiding at approx. 4.4 chars/sec, identical across all segments. This segment carries 63 chars (proportional half), cut at the natural pause before the clause about entrusting reputation-ruining secrets. Cutting plan: 3 shots; Shot A sets the hypothetical fallout, Shot B lands the private vow of silence, Shot C suspends the sentence on the weight of sharing a shameful secret (English paraphrase: the moment someone entrusts you with secrets that could ruin their name is the proof of deepest trust), bridging seamlessly into Segment 2.\n\n4. retention_and_lock\n<Image 1>: fully_preserved - identical face, hair, wardrobe; strictly_locked environment - identical bedroom, bedding, teddy bear, floral curtains, soft window light, no hallucinated objects.\n<Audio 1>: strictly_locked_voice_timbre.\n\n5. detailed_timeline_with_cinematography\nThe target video is in raw documentary vlog style. Global Pacing: Steady confiding (approx. 4.4 chars/sec), identical across all segments. Identical lighting/wardrobe/background across all cuts; audio continuous across cuts. AUDIO MIX: 100% dry vocal, 0% BGM, 0% ambient noise.\n\n[00:00 - 00:06] **Shot A — Medium Shot (narrative setup)**:\n**Camera**: Slow steady push-in from a medium shot with subtle handheld breathing sway, single continuous path.\n**Action & Angle**: She sits on the bed exactly as in <Image 1>, open book on her lap, teddy bear beside her; she lifts her gaze from the pages to the lens, lips moving naturally in sync with the spoken words, expression soft and sincere, fingers resting on the page edge.\n**Vocal Direction**: Speaking in Mandarin Chinese. Use exact timbre from <Audio 1>. Pacing: Steady confiding, approx. 4.4 chars/sec.\nSpoken Dialogue (Lip-sync): \"如果有一天我们绝交了，翻脸了，你出门跟全世界骂我，\"\n\nAt 00:06, **HARD CUT** (Cut motivation: emotional turn from hypothetical public betrayal to an intimate private vow, so the frame punches in closer.)\n\n[00:06 - 00:12] **Shot B — Intimate Close-Up (vow of secrecy)**:\n**Camera**: Continued slow push-in at close range, shallow depth of field with floral curtain bokeh, single continuous path.\n**Action & Angle**: Slight head tilt, eyes locked on the lens, lips moving naturally in sync with the spoken words; a faint reassuring head shake and softened brows; micro-expressions of quiet loyalty.\n**Vocal Direction**: Same unified pacing; tone warm and firmly reassuring.\nSpoken Dialogue (Lip-sync): \"我也不会把你哭着笑着在深夜只分享给我秘密告诉别人。\"\n\nAt 00:12, **HARD CUT** (Cut motivation: the sentence pivots toward the heavy idea of entrusting a reputation-ruining secret; settle into the anchor framing that Segment 2 will inherit.)\n\n[00:12 - 00:15] **Shot C — Medium Close-Up Anchor (suspense bridge)**:\n**Camera**: Stable medium close-up with minimal drift, held until 00:15.000; this is the exact framing the next segment opens on.\n**Action & Angle**: Book lowered slightly on her lap, lips moving naturally through the hanging clause, steady reflective gaze, calm visible breath.\n**Vocal Direction**: Same unified pacing; voice lowers slightly with gravity, sentence left intentionally unfinished.\nSpoken Dialogue (Lip-sync): \"一个人把能让自己身败名裂，\"\n\n6. audio_hierarchy_and_mixing\nAUDIO MIX: 100% isolated spoken dialogue matching <Audio 1> timbre, 0% BGM, 0% ambient noise. Voice track continuous across cuts.\n\n7. strict_negative_constraints\nSPEECH: The character speaks ONLY the exact Chinese lines wrapped in double quotes. Every other word is a production instruction and must NEVER be vocalized.\nAUDIO: ZERO BGM, ZERO noise. DO NOT change voice timbre. DO NOT drag or rush. NO VOICEOVER.\nVISUAL: No more than 3 shots per 15s. No unmotivated cuts. No lighting/wardrobe/background change across cuts. No standing or walking; seated confiding only. No robotic motion. No closed mouth during spoken shots. No uncanny lip-sync. No mutated hands."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [400, 530], "pos": [-2194.425537109375, 5725.81787109375], "id": 137, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [264], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "frame_count", "label": "frame_count", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "frame_count"}, {"name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"name": "video_info", "label": "video_info", "type": "VHS_VIDEOINFO", "localized_name": "video_info"}], "size": [260, 3